<title>CHINA: China listed firms top list of largest retailers.</title>
<headline>China listed firms top list of largest retailers.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Listed firms account for seven of the 10 largest retailers in China based on 1996 sales, with Shanghai No.1 Department Store Co Ltd topping the list, the Shanghai Securities News said on Friday.</p>
<p>Sales of Shanghai No.1 Department Store in 1996 amounted to 2.677 billion yuan ($323 million), followed by Shanghai Yuyuan Tourist Super Bazaar Co Ltd with sales of 2.431 billion yuan, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>($1=8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
